UNI_ARM_Debtor_Body+type:stat\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\"><img alt=\"https://bg3.norbyte.dev/search?q=name:UNI_ARM_Debtor_Body+type:stat\" src=\"/w/images/7/70/Search_icon.svg\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"14\" height=\"14\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></a></span></span></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Special_2\">Special</span></h3>\n<p>The wearer of this item gains:\n\n</p>\n<ul><li>While wearing this item, eternal debtors in the House of Hope will remain neutral towards the party. If any party members are seen in the House of Hope without the Debtor's Attire, eternal debtors will become hostile towards the entire party.</li></ul>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div></div>    \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Where_to_find_2\"> Where to find </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Hope\" title=\"House of Hope\">House of Hope</a>: Given to the party by <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon bg3wiki-round-image\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Hope\" title=\"Hope\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Portrait_Hope.png/25px-Portrait_Hope.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/f6/Portrait_Hope.png/38px-Portrait_Hope.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/f/f6/Portrait_Hope.png/50px-Portrait_Hope.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Hope\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/f6/Portrait_Hope.png/25px-Portrait_Hope.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/f/f6/Portrait_Hope.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Hope\" title=\"Hope\">Hope</a></li>\n<li>In various containers in the <a href=\"/wiki/House_of_Hope\" title=\"House of Hope\">House of Hope</a></li></ul>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Notes_2\"> Notes </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<ul><li><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/25px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/38px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png 2x\"><img alt=\"Prerequisite Icon.png\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png/25px-Prerequisite_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></span><a href=\"/w/images/f/fd/Prerequisite_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span><span class=\"bg3wiki-prereq\">Indebted Disguise is <i>not active</i> on characters under the effects of <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Shape\" title=\"Wild Shape\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp/20px-Wild_Shape_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp/30px-Wild_Shape_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp/40px-Wild_Shape_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Wild Shape\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp/20px-Wild_Shape_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/b/b9/Wild_Shape_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Wild_Shape\" title=\"Wild Shape\">Wild Shape</a>.</span></li></ul>\n</div>  \n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714195945\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [vary‐revision‐sha1, no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.101 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.106 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 3969/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 50965/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 13428/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 22/200\nExpensive parser function count: 1/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐